	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"映画『ドラゴンボール超 ブロリー』より、最強のサイヤ人ブロリーを立体化！",
			"• 特徴的な腰巻や衣装を新規造形で再現。",
			"• 躍動感のある筋肉の造形により、強靭な肉体を表現。",
			"• 差し替え式の表情パーツと手首パーツにより力強いポーズを再現可能。",
			"• 特徴的な傷跡は曲面への追従性が高いマーキングシールで再現！",
			"• 表情パーツは「叫び」と「怒り」の２種付属。",
			"• 悟空とベジータ用のダメージ顔が付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From the movie \"Dragon Ball Super: Broly\", the strongest Saiyan Broly is now in 3D!",
			"• Reproduce the characteristic loincloth and costume with new modeling.",
			"• Expressing a strong body with dynamic muscle modeling.",
			"• Reproduce powerful poses with interchangeable expression parts and wrist parts.",
			"• Characteristic scars are reproduced with MarkingSeal, which has high followability on curved surfaces!",
			"• Two types of facial expression parts are included: \"screaming\" and \"angry\".",
			"• Includes damaged faces for Goku and Vegeta."
		]
	},
